SUMMARY:SAM COLLINS
DESCRIPTION:SAT 22 AUG | @samcollinsmusic \nWith releases on Experts Only\, Confession and\nArmada\, plus support from Solomun\, John Summit\,\nMau P\, Gordo and The Martinez Brothers\, Sam Collins\nhas built a name far beyond Amsterdam. \nFrom clubs across Europe to festival stages worldwide\,\nhis tech house productions continue to find their way\ninto the sets of the scene’s biggest names. \nInfo & VIP: +66 (0) 64 454 4985 | info@illuzionphuket.com
